From 542302b363b8cd12423037854428179a6bc81652 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 14:41:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add SC26 outreach module (send, open/click/reply tracking)

New /sc26-outreach route + /api/sc26-outreach/* API for the Supercomputing
2026 sales outreach campaign: CSV prospect import (reusing the app's
existing CSV/Papa conventions), sending via a connected DDN Outlook mailbox
over Microsoft Graph (app-only auth, create-draft+send so we capture a
conversationId), an open-tracking pixel, a click-tracked redirect for the
booking link, and a Graph change-notification webhook that matches inbound
replies back to the original send by conversationId.

Off by default behind NEXT_PUBLIC_ENABLE_SC26_OUTREACH. See
docs/SC26_OUTREACH_SETUP.md for the required Azure AD app registration,
Exchange Application Access Policy scoping, and Render deployment steps --
none of which can be done from the app itself.
